[{"id":181217984,"discussion_id":"b593e34eb786ff194d2122e978635f1449f225ac","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了大内核（big kernel）场景下 `conv3d_v2` 算子中的一个错误，主要涉及 `IsBigKernelCiBL1Tail` 尾部判断逻辑的修正以及 `bL1Offset` 计算方式的简化。修改集中在文件 `conv/conv3d_v2/op_kernel/arch35/conv3d_v2_instr_base_impl.h`，共变更 5 行。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **修正 `IsBigKernelCiBL1Tail` 尾部迭代判断逻辑**：将原来的 `(kBL1Iter / ddr2L1LoopKw / ddr2L1LoopKh) == cinBL1LoopTimes - 1` 直接相等判断，改为 `(kBL1Iter / ddr2L1LoopKw / ddr2L1LoopKh + 1) % cinBL1LoopTimes == 0` 取模判断，确保迭代索引在循环边界处能正确识别尾部位置，避免因整数除法截断导致尾部条件漏判。\n- **简化 `bL1Offset` 计算**：将 `AlignB(currentBL1Cin1, Intf::k0)` 替换为直接使用 `Intf::k0`，移除了对 `currentBL1Cin1` 的对齐运算，改为以常量 `k0` 作为偏移基准。\n- **文件末尾换行修复**：在 `#endif` 之后补回了缺失的换行符，使文件符合 POSIX 行尾规范。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-22T19:27:18+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-22T19:33:00+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181217986,"discussion_id":"8202f8a135d36d58a5f91c0cd70db03c4ff3935b","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n对变更文件 `conv/conv3d_v2/op_kernel/arch35/conv3d_v2_instr_base_impl.h` 的逐行审查完成。\n\n### 审查结论\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 | 说明 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| P0     | 0    | —     |\n| P1     | 0    | —     |\n| P2     | 1    | `bL1Offset` 简化可能在大卷积核场景下产生不正确的 L1 跨步 |\n| P3     | 0    | —     |\n\n### 发现详情\n\n- **P2**（置信度 0.6）：`bL1Offset`（第 298 行）从 `AlignB(currentBL1Cin1, k0) * kwL1 * nBL1` 改为 `k0 * kwL1 * nBL1`，移除了 `currentBL1Cin1` 对 L1 跨步的贡献。如果大卷积核 tiling 中 `bL1Cin` 始终等于 `k0`，此简化安全；否则可能导致 L1 数据覆盖。需确认 tiling 保证。\n\n### 各变更审查确认\n\n- **`IsBigKernelCiBL1Tail` 尾块检测修复**（第 363–368 行）：将 `X == cinBL1LoopTimes - 1` 改为 `(X + 1) % cinBL1LoopTimes == 0`，修复了仅第一个 dk 分组能检测到尾块的 bug，现正确处理所有 dk 分组。此为正确的 bug 修复。\n- **`bL1Offset` 变更**（第 298 行）：已上报 P2 finding。\n- **文件末尾换行符**（第 377 行）：新增换行符，POSIX 合规改进，无问题。\n\n### 整体风险判断\n\n低风险。`IsBigKernelCiBL1Tail` 的修复明确解决了尾块漏检的 bug。`bL1Offset` 的简化在大卷积核 tiling 通常将 `bL1Cin` 设为 `k0` 的前提下是无操作简化，但建议确认 tiling 保证以避免潜在回归。\n\n> ⚠️ 已识别出整体风险，但无法提取行内评论，请参考整体评估。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-22T19:27:18+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-22T19:49:04+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181218002,"discussion_id":"8183fbee9cfc18582384303ec473c5a614e1ec32","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n huafeng793, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-22T19:27:25+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-22T19:27:25+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181218005,"discussion_id":"a239613fad3122fe671a88bdc679baa8bc2f4796","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve